#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:1 6ec76a49d59e45fbbf702f5561466868
msgid "Gym Trading Environment"
msgstr "Gym 交易环境"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:3 21b03473eaed4aa38ee6156f6a932b81
msgid ""
"QTrade ships a [Gymnasium](https://gymnasium.farama.org/) environment "
"(`qtrade.env.TradingEnv`) that wraps the same `Broker` as `Backtest`. The"
" agent steps through bars one at a time; same accounting, fill semantics,"
" SL/TP behavior — just driven by `step()` instead of a Python loop."
msgstr ""
"QTrade 提供一个 [Gymnasium](https://gymnasium.farama.org/) 环境"
"（`qtrade.env.TradingEnv`），它包装的是和 `Backtest` 同一个 `Broker`。"
"agent 一次推进一根 bar；账户逻辑、成交语义、SL/TP 行为完全一致 —— "
"只是用 `step()` 驱动而不是 Python 循环。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:9 98561b040366444c8894812943e70036
msgid ""
"For customizing the action / observation / reward, see [Customizing "
"Trading Environment](customize_environment.md)."
msgstr ""
"自定义 action / observation / reward 见[自定义交易环境](customize_environment.md)。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:12 f4c7b53f1beb4a298924137112612b32
msgid "Initializing"
msgstr "初始化"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:43 ddedbd1d6c1c435c9c6e059a05c05bcd
msgid ""
"The default `ObserverScheme` returns a `(window_size, n_features)` window"
" of every column except OHLCV. So the indicators you add to the DataFrame"
" become the observation features automatically."
msgstr ""
"默认的 `ObserverScheme` 返回除 OHLCV 之外所有列的 `(window_size, n_features)` 窗口。"
"所以你加到 DataFrame 上的指标会自动变成观测特征。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:47 8a93e6e26e804eadb4f8cfd2098e2e52
msgid "The step API"
msgstr "step API"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:49 1fd387b1f5b0406bac70428531f49879
msgid "`env.step(action)` returns the standard 5-tuple:"
msgstr "`env.step(action)` 返回标准 5 元组："

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 636335f1fe6f41a4a5dba3896f85817f
msgid "Field"
msgstr "字段"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 8aa627a14854412d9838e78a4ec88fa1
#: cf1a9b3526fe4c70872db9fe8c18e62b
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 93f4dc8235264d869de9090b74f40777
msgid "`obs`"
msgstr "`obs`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md d088bdd3ab9d4fe39a45f59b0cb85d1a
msgid ""
"Whatever the `ObserverScheme` produces. Default: `np.ndarray` of shape "
"`(window_size, n_features)`."
msgstr ""
"`ObserverScheme` 产生的内容。默认：形状 `(window_size, n_features)` 的 `np.ndarray`。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 5d2617397be8440593b613379e678c2b
msgid "`reward`"
msgstr "`reward`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 7464ea24cee54f54b49a7e6b0c83819a
msgid ""
"`RewardScheme.get_reward(env)`. Default: log-return of trades closed this"
" step minus commission."
msgstr ""
"`RewardScheme.get_reward(env)`。默认：本步关闭交易的对数收益减去佣金。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 8b00ae0e786c410598a12e9b89fb7eca
msgid "`terminated`"
msgstr "`terminated`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md a01e0bd37cbb464191541ced84f6b498
msgid "`True` iff `current_step >= len(data) - 1` — the data ran out."
msgstr "当且仅当 `current_step >= len(data) - 1` 时为 `True` —— 数据用完了。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 25893bf688e5428eae28c8a5d35d6500
msgid "`truncated`"
msgstr "`truncated`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md a930071e8dc941a29cdf21d5f43fd7ea
msgid ""
"`True` iff `current_step - start_idx >= max_steps` — the episode hit its "
"time limit."
msgstr ""
"当且仅当 `current_step - start_idx >= max_steps` 时为 `True` —— episode 到时间限制。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 3fed357ba7854f9da1e44e7318a59735
msgid "`info`"
msgstr "`info`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 7d83a4b366cb41ceb2faa4f1123fb082
msgid "Dict (see below)."
msgstr "字典（见下文）。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:63 9243887d64ac4eb09bdfb0a85a6f6eef
msgid ""
"When either `terminated` or `truncated` becomes True, the broker calls "
"`close_all_positions()` automatically — the episode is \"settled\" before"
" returning."
msgstr ""
"`terminated` 或 `truncated` 变 True 时，broker 自动调用 `close_all_positions()` —— "
"episode 在返回前已「结算」。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:67 59cbbf1ad3cb4c169b0a7f069886795b
msgid "What's in `info`?"
msgstr "`info` 里有什么？"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:69 cd7478a90980461d9b7385a2a39ad8da
msgid "Every step:"
msgstr "每一步包含："

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 99ca13da75f045f6b3d44c75fb415729
msgid "Key"
msgstr "键"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md a3bc6a9a132942cbbe55302445199735
msgid "`equity`"
msgstr "`equity`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md c58009bdb98d4fba8497b3b81d156b50
msgid "`broker.equity` (cash + unrealized PnL)."
msgstr "`broker.equity`（现金 + 浮动盈亏）。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 68303c60014e4005b736ebc7fa429f9d
msgid "`unrealized_pnl`"
msgstr "`unrealized_pnl`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md cbc9a6b5c0d3486abaa6dee6a6d725d8
msgid "`broker.unrealized_pnl`."
msgstr "`broker.unrealized_pnl`。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 887af900c5ec48a3a22b118bbb3d77fc
msgid "`cumulative_return`"
msgstr "`cumulative_return`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md a3bfcaa33a134199b0ed44d9174fa483
msgid ""
"`broker.cumulative_returns` — multiplicative growth since the episode "
"start."
msgstr ""
"`broker.cumulative_returns` —— 自 episode 开始的乘性增长。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md d9da77d2d30943a5817dfee3976b017d
msgid "`position`"
msgstr "`position`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md d8757d6d549645d09f2bb5d717306583
msgid "Net signed `position.size`."
msgstr "带符号的 `position.size` 净值。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 168393e7cbcf45f0a1f40c5caed8cbbc
msgid "`total_trades`"
msgstr "`total_trades`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md c5c131cecbab4a3582e92eabc4797546
msgid "Count of closed trades so far this episode."
msgstr "本 episode 至今已平仓交易数。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md c16852378a264cf7a53b6492fc9ede16
msgid "`trades_profit`"
msgstr "`trades_profit`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 69fc6e6059b843099458103bb96af0eb
msgid "Sum of `profit` across all closed trades."
msgstr "所有已平仓交易 `profit` 之和。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 6c0d53609def4bfd8c5093ff1d0f85e2
msgid "`avg_trade_duration`"
msgstr "`avg_trade_duration`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 9877ecc4825543a2ba41be618ef349c6
msgid "Mean `exit_index − entry_index` in bars (0 if no trades)."
msgstr "平均 `exit_index − entry_index`（按 bar 计；无交易时为 0）。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md e5f1412ecba9486baf3991659d796e1b
msgid "`is_success`"
msgstr "`is_success`"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md 99bf7a41f435432e91448940109d4922
msgid "`trades_profit > 0`. Useful for SB3's `EvalCallback` success-rate logging."
msgstr "`trades_profit > 0`。便于 SB3 `EvalCallback` 记录成功率。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:82 a9002a07c94c49dd8d7c32ea134ea5c1
msgid ""
"If you need additional fields (open trade count, drawdown so far, "
"specific trade properties), subclass `TradingEnv` and override `step` to "
"extend the dict."
msgstr ""
"如需额外字段（持仓中交易数、当前回撤、特定交易属性），继承 `TradingEnv` "
"并重写 `step` 来扩展这个 dict。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:86 c21f3ea9ff4a4524b7f23f87bdee0bc8
msgid "Episodes: terminated vs truncated"
msgstr "Episode：terminated vs truncated"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:88 a0e051248f3d40c687bb53a183ba2621
msgid "The Gymnasium convention is:"
msgstr "Gymnasium 的约定是："

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:90 c79e26b7d2ed40ad9ca1109c943d157e
msgid ""
"**`terminated`**: the episode reached a *natural* end (won, lost, or ran "
"out of valid states)."
msgstr ""
"**`terminated`**：episode 到达*自然*终点（胜、负或可用状态耗尽）。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:92 65f20a7905cc49d4bc02d037a5a5a5bc
msgid "**`truncated`**: the episode was *cut* by an artificial time limit."
msgstr "**`truncated`**：episode 被人为时间限制*截断*。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:94 1c95fb5bface42f4ae7f1af1b6916d1b
msgid "In `TradingEnv`:"
msgstr "在 `TradingEnv` 里："

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:96 f2c901fa80844088a05d5b6276eef7d9
msgid ""
"`terminated` fires when there's no more data (`current_step == len(data) "
"- 1`). The episode is \"complete.\""
msgstr ""
"`terminated` 在数据用完时触发（`current_step == len(data) - 1`）。Episode 「完整结束」。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:98 7770aa5ba828480d95690db3385c4d3d
msgid ""
"`truncated` fires when `max_steps` is reached. The episode could have "
"continued but you set a budget."
msgstr ""
"`truncated` 在达到 `max_steps` 时触发。Episode 本可以继续，但你设置了预算。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:101 5c053610252c4efcbd52a2ff77155d94
msgid ""
"`stable-baselines3`'s value bootstrapping treats them differently — make "
"sure you set `max_steps` short enough that most episodes truncate (so the"
" agent learns from many short episodes), but not so short that the "
"strategy never has time to play out."
msgstr ""
"`stable-baselines3` 的值函数 bootstrap 对二者处理不同 —— "
"把 `max_steps` 设得短到大多数 episode 是 truncate（让 agent 从多个短 episode 学），"
"但不能短到策略没机会展开。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:106 c5e963418aef4aa3bbc07e37f9562618
msgid "`random_start` for episode diversity"
msgstr "`random_start` 增加 episode 多样性"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:108 849690a069a74283abc220c3797e8ab5
msgid ""
"By default `random_start=False`: every episode starts at bar index "
"`window_size`. With `random_start=True`, each `reset()` picks a random "
"start in `[window_size, len(data) - max_steps)`, so episodes sample "
"different market regimes."
msgstr ""
"默认 `random_start=False`：每个 episode 都从 bar 索引 `window_size` 开始。"
"`random_start=True` 时，每次 `reset()` 在 `[window_size, len(data) - max_steps)` "
"范围随机选起点，让 episode 采样不同的市场 regime。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:113 f7e9967be0dd4c9290afabc341933eb9
msgid ""
"Required: `len(data) > window_size + max_steps`. The constructor raises a"
" clear `ValueError` if not — keep `max_steps` < `len(data) - window_size`"
" to leave room."
msgstr ""
"前置条件：`len(data) > window_size + max_steps`。不满足时构造函数抛出清晰的 "
"`ValueError` —— 保持 `max_steps` < `len(data) - window_size` 留余地。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:117 0f91bcb91b964f4394c63b2d2ff607bd
msgid "A typical training loop"
msgstr "典型训练循环"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:136 c7fbe46fd5d24ae393b676628fbbc99a
msgid ""
"`env.show_stats()` and `env.plot()` work the same as on a `Backtest` "
"instance — same metrics, same multi-panel Bokeh report — because they "
"both delegate to the underlying `Broker`."
msgstr ""
"`env.show_stats()` 和 `env.plot()` 行为和 `Backtest` 实例完全一致 —— "
"相同指标、相同的多面板 Bokeh 报告 —— 因为底层都委托给同一个 `Broker`。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:140 7e6ca5610b3f4654b8d3137385acdb2c
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr "渲染"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:142 32c129e78f6144ff9291668e2b738f12
msgid ""
"`env.render('human')` opens a live mplfinance candle chart updating every"
" step:"
msgstr ""
"`env.render('human')` 打开一个 mplfinance 实时蜡烛图，每步更新："

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:145 4ddd30a224874cc2bde7b7ee0c47e691
msgid "![Trading Environment Render](../_static/render_rgb.gif)"
msgstr "![Trading Environment Render](../_static/render_rgb.gif)"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:145 ce9c1da7e48c4b9680355e237b2b013b
msgid "Trading Environment Render"
msgstr "交易环境渲染"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:147 f1c89e9c163540149f1fb8bb9bb0de1e
msgid "For RGB array output (e.g. SB3's `VecVideoRecorder`):"
msgstr "RGB 数组输出（用于 SB3 的 `VecVideoRecorder` 等）："

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:154 6bb969e06a594fe386ed022bfc9a4950
msgid ""
"Heads up: rendering is slow. For training, leave it off "
"(`render_mode='human'` is the default but you don't have to *call* "
"`render()`) and only render during evaluation."
msgstr ""
"注意：渲染很慢。训练时关闭它（`render_mode='human'` 是默认值，但你不必*调用* `render()`），"
"只在评估时渲染。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:158 787896a9154343879b075f5dc88b20c3
msgid "Common pitfalls"
msgstr "常见坑"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:160 6cb3baa834c042d09754e2baab61247f
msgid ""
"**Sparse reward**: the default reward only fires on bars where a trade "
"closes. Long episodes with no closures train poorly. Either use an "
"equity-based reward (see [Customizing Trading "
"Environment](customize_environment.md)) or shorten episodes so end-of-"
"episode auto-closure provides regular signal."
msgstr ""
"**稀疏奖励**：默认奖励只在有交易平仓的 bar 触发。长 episode 没有平仓很难训练。"
"要么用基于权益的奖励（见[自定义交易环境](customize_environment.md)），"
"要么缩短 episode 让结尾的自动平仓提供规律信号。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:165 f51b3e9653274c139bd6b27eefb4ee26
msgid ""
"**Indicators with NaN at start**: any column you add to `data` is "
"observed as-is. NaN in the observation crashes most policies. Drop the "
"warmup rows with `data.dropna(inplace=True)` after computing indicators."
msgstr ""
"**指标开头有 NaN**：你加到 `data` 上的列会被原样观测。"
"观测里出现 NaN 会让大多数策略崩溃。计算指标后用 `data.dropna(inplace=True)` 丢掉热身行。"

#: ../guide/trading_environment.md:169 b1b99fdc095a491387800c1009571bcf
msgid ""
"**Action / observation drift**: if you change schemes mid-experiment and "
"load an old model, you'll get shape mismatches. Save model and scheme "
"together when you're going to load."
msgstr ""
"**Action / observation 漂移**：实验中途换 scheme 后加载旧模型会形状不匹配。"
"打算后续加载的模型和对应的 scheme 一起保存。"
